d fox tales  finding his way to earth  a sequel was a foregone conclusion after  the movie crossed an impressive 310  million us dollars despite the  outbreak of the pandemic for a long  period of time there was no information  about the sequel's plot based on the  mid-credits scene it was merely assumed  that sonic's longtime friend tales would  make an appearance  for a few days now however the mystery  about the plot is not quite as  mysterious anymore  as the complete synopsis of the sequel  was accidentally published on the  website  of the us copyright office according to  the synopsis tom and maddie go on  vacation and leave sonic at home in  green hills as  you can imagine this is not a good idea  at all since dr robotnik has found his  way back to earth  so far not too surprising however  the mad scientist is not alone as has  been speculated in the past  knuckles is at robotnik side this time  the scientist's attention is not only on  sonic but mainly on a mysterious emerald  that has the power not only to destroy  entire civilizations  but also to create them of course if  this weapon were to be in robotnik's  hands this would be disastrous which is  why tails and sonic set out on a mission  to prevent robotnik and knuckles from  achieving their goal  although the official synopsis answered  a lot of questions there are still some  aspects that haven't been clarified yet  first is the question of sonic's home  planet where he's been chased by a group  of enemies  this group is neither mentioned by name  nor do we see a representative in the  movie who could solve the mystery  it is possible that it is the knuckles  clan known mostly from the video games  this clan spent most of its time on rage  trying to take over the powerful chaos  emeralds ultimately  they failed under the ruthless leader  which meant the downfall of the clan  possibly in the sonic cinematic universe  the clan has regained its own strength  and wants to capture the blue hatchet to  learn more about its superpower and who  could be better qualified for the job  than knuckles himself  the red echidna has been known since the  video game sonic the hedgehog 3 in which  he's manipulated by robotnik into  thinking that sonic wants to steal the  emeralds  later on knuckles realizes robotnik's  foul play and befriend sonic it seems  like the storyline of the video game  could easily be picked up in the sequel  but who knows maybe there will be  another mind-bending plot twist awaiting  us  now we want to go into more detail on  the new additions to sonic 2.  especially for fans of the movie who are  not so well-versed in the video games we  have prepared some  interesting information our first  character is the already mentioned  knuckles the red echidna is one of the  most popular characters in the sonic  universe even though as we said before  he cooperates with robotnik at first his  superpowers include close combat with  his spiky gloves and climbing walls  quickly  he is the last surviving member of the  knuckles clan and rather serious and  determinant character in spite of often  being a bit too gullible as well  one vulnerability is certainly his quick  temper which occasionally causes  knuckles to lose his composure even when  dealing with friends  although he's not as fast as sonic he's  clearly stronger and more battle-tasted  which makes him not only one of the  strongest characters in the franchise  but also one of the most popular  the other character already touched upon  in the mid-credits scene  is miles per hour alias tales his name  miles prower  is a reference to the english speed  measurement miles per hour  he's a welcome guest in numerous sonic  games and not just due to the yellow fox  likeable demeanor his character  contrasts with that of knuckles those  tails is rather modest and nice  in addition he is incredibly smart and  very well versed in the field of  technology  his most famous superpower consists of  being able to fly with his two rotating  tails  tails doesn't need to hide from sonic's  supersonic speed since dance is one of  the few characters capable of keeping up  with sonic he reaches his speed by  curling up into a ball  a couple of weeks ago filming on sonic 2  was completed  appropriately director jafala posted a  picture of himself sitting in a field of  mushrooms  small reference to the planet to which  robotnik was teleported  the hard work really begins in  post-production though after all the  video game characters have to be  animated and added to the footage first  in addition to the large production team  around toby asher tim miller and others  the voice actors and the actress who  will be appearing  are of particular interest unfortunately  not much is known so far except that jim  carrey is back in the role of dr  ivo robotnik and that james marston and  tikka sumter will again play the  waykovsky couple  sonic voice actor ben schwartz will also  be back though it is still  completely unclear who will be dubbing  tales and knuckles  a couple of months ago we did report  about rumors surrounding the sink of  newcomer knuckles  aquaman star jason mamoa and dwayne the  rock johnson were both mentioned as  potential voice actors in the reports it  remains to be seen whether one of them  will  indeed lend his voice to the fan  favorite character  until the release of sonic the hedgehog  2 on april 8 2022 we will no doubt  find out even more exciting information  which we will of course publish in our  weekly news  if you're looking forward to the first  trailer you should definitely subscribe  to our channel in order to not miss it  as we expect it to be online at the  latest by late october or  early november that's it for our latest  video  what are your hopes for the upcoming  sequel and what are your speculations  regarding the plot  let's discuss in the comments if you  liked the video feel free to leave a  like  see you next time  [Music]  recently some said 